1. Ticket Summary & Business Context

Client: Bright Path

Objective: Address an outdated 19-day EBS snapshot gap (violating a 24-hour RPO), provision concurrent Linux file sharing, design object storage for incoming document uploads, and implement a strict 7-year immutable retention mandate for completed archival records.

Governance Notice: No production changes are authorized under ticket TKT-2026-0010. All configurations and commands represent engineering recommendations and non-destructive practice lab tasks.

