8. Escalation Notes & Lessons Learned

Escalation Boundary: No production changes were executed. Applying immutable S3 Object Lock policies requires formal Architecture Review Board (ARB), Change Advisory Board (CAB), and legal approvals.

Lessons Learned: When managing versioned S3 buckets, unversioned legacy objects store under a "VersionId": "null" attribute and must be explicitly targeted prior to bucket deletion. Verifying cloud resource hygiene prevents unnecessary recurring charges and eliminates residual security risks.
